                                "sense_id": "cdece278-3c5d-377f-8fab-a9b257c5efc7",
                                "text": "Too - soon expose thee not , to Sisters - spareless"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "545d9ce9-a931-4c67-8c6f-bc46f29075ae",
                                "sense_id": "cdece278-3c5d-377f-8fab-a9b257c5efc7",
                                "text": "When all the friends that blessed his prime, Were vanished like a morning dream; Plucked one by one by spareless Time, And scatteredin oblivion's stream;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "435552c6-bf5d-4bee-b8ba-6f66846c1889",
                                "sense_id": "cdece278-3c5d-377f-8fab-a9b257c5efc7",
                                "text": "But Hubba, at his early death incensed, Swell'd into fury: with supernal strength Burst the closed gates: struck by his spareless sword, Alas! mid echoing screams and groans, o'er all Those hallow'd aisles, unnumber'd victims fell, Whom with a voice of thunder Hubba sent Cursing to Hela"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8824384b-afab-329c-9f2a-9ba401ed0b97",
                        "entry_id": "8f33bacc-d337-3ce7-b779-2b336ad82a86",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lacking a spare tire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6504fc97-17b3-411a-a5b6-f31ab7978710",
                                "sense_id": "8824384b-afab-329c-9f2a-9ba401ed0b97",
                                "text": "A more reliable, spareless solution is the run-flat tire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "753c6513-d48b-4af4-af7d-1f61cdb701b4",
                                "sense_id": "8824384b-afab-329c-9f2a-9ba401ed0b97",
                                "text": "However, until the spareless car gains acceptance, spare tires will be provided on all the passenger cars."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e50018c-c90c-47d9-8fd4-dd6ea623da5c",
                                "sense_id": "8824384b-afab-329c-9f2a-9ba401ed0b97",
                                "text": "The purpose of your tire-patch package is to keep you on the road and keep you from being spareless after a puncture-flat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aba4ca98-2656-47b5-a8a1-ac002b466c87",
                                "sense_id": "8824384b-afab-329c-9f2a-9ba401ed0b97",
                                "text": "Since I carried only one spare, I had many an anxious moment running spareless on bald rubber ."
                            }
                        ]
